WEBVTT

02:13.820 --> 02:14.820
Iason...

02:16.180 --> 02:17.000
Mink...

02:30.600 --> 02:35.000
Midas, Area 1
Three years ago

03:02.100 --> 03:05.730
I disapprove of that kind of behavior.

03:06.900 --> 03:09.270
What are you doing?

03:09.270 --> 03:11.040
A Blon...die?

03:12.540 --> 03:14.210
What is this?

03:19.380 --> 03:22.720
Hasn't got a PAM.
A mongrel, huh?

03:23.180 --> 03:25.290
Don't go around picking up weirdos.

03:25.320 --> 03:27.290
I have better things to do.

03:27.320 --> 03:28.490
Good.

03:31.320 --> 03:34.830
Cut it out if you're just playing around.

03:35.960 --> 03:38.460
Watch yourself. There won't be a second time.

03:39.370 --> 03:41.100
Hey, wait.

03:45.540 --> 03:47.640
Why are you letting me go?

03:50.010 --> 03:52.150
I just felt like it.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.590
Wait!

04:04.020 --> 04:08.190
Hey, how long do you plan to stand there?

04:08.190 --> 04:10.630
There's no point putting up an act here.

04:10.660 --> 04:12.970
Let's get it over and done with.

04:13.630 --> 04:19.610
So when you fail at pickpocketing, you make money by seducing men?

04:20.770 --> 04:27.510
Unfortunately, I'm not crazy enough to make out with a mongrel of the slum.

04:28.180 --> 04:33.420
And it is not of my own will that I am forced here.

04:33.450 --> 04:36.390
It's a nuisance.

04:36.420 --> 04:40.030
Or, do you have some other agenda?

04:40.030 --> 04:44.960
As they say, there's no such thing as a free lunch.

04:45.000 --> 04:49.100
If you don't feel like it, why did you follow me all the way here?

04:49.140 --> 04:54.770
Or did you want to have a friendly chat with a mongrel of the slum?

04:57.010 --> 05:01.080
Fuck me. I hate owing people favors.

05:01.150 --> 05:04.180
Especially creeps like you.

05:04.950 --> 05:10.260
There's no way that you're one level above everyone else just because you're a Tanagura Blondie.

05:10.320 --> 05:17.200
Or is it because you can't deal with a mongrel of the slum after being spolied with high pedigree pets all your life?

05:18.670 --> 05:22.700
It's okay, you can run home with your tail between your legs.

05:22.740 --> 05:25.270
It's not like anyone saw you.

05:25.300 --> 05:30.640
You'd rather pay with your body than owe a debt to someone you don't like.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.450
Am I right?

05:32.480 --> 05:36.350
It's cleaner this way, no regrets.

05:36.780 --> 05:40.620
If that is the way of the slum, I accept that.

05:40.650 --> 05:46.230
Just don't forget. You said I can do whatever I like.

05:46.260 --> 05:48.800
You can't threaten me with that.

05:50.430 --> 05:52.370
Show me then.

05:52.400 --> 05:57.400
See if you are good enough for a Tanagura Blondie.

06:10.550 --> 06:16.160
It's not a bad thing to make someone cry once in a while.

06:16.960 --> 06:20.290
Let me thoroughly explore your body.

06:23.330 --> 06:26.700
What kind of exploration is this, with your gloves still on?

06:26.770 --> 06:30.200
You think we're vermin?

06:30.640 --> 06:35.780
I'm just treating you as a pet of Tanagura.

06:36.310 --> 06:38.080
Are you unsatisfied with this?

06:38.140 --> 06:41.510
Then take off your clothes too.

06:46.820 --> 06:49.520
Get it right, mongrel.

06:49.560 --> 06:53.460
This is my bribe for keeping quiet about you being a public nuisance.

06:53.490 --> 06:58.770
So, you just have to do as I say, and cry for me.

06:58.800 --> 07:00.100
That's all.

07:01.130 --> 07:03.700
There is no need for anything else.

07:07.940 --> 07:14.120
Three months later

07:20.690 --> 07:24.090
Wednesday 3:30pm
Moga Street, Red Baron

07:56.760 --> 07:59.330
You're right on time. Good.

07:59.790 --> 08:04.360
Since you made it here, seems like you have some level of competency.

08:04.400 --> 08:09.600
The watch you got from Zach was rather useful, wasn't it?

08:11.170 --> 08:12.070
Name?

08:12.100 --> 08:13.240
Riki.

08:13.340 --> 08:14.470
Age?

08:14.510 --> 08:15.580
Fifteen.

08:15.640 --> 08:18.910
Have you been informed about the specifics of the job?

08:18.950 --> 08:20.150
Not at all.

08:20.180 --> 08:25.720
Zach said that, for the time being, whether or not I take the job would be settled after I met you.

08:25.790 --> 08:27.690
What I want is...

08:27.720 --> 08:34.490
Someone who can reliably deliver things for me at the determined time and place.

08:34.990 --> 08:38.430
It's good to have someone sharp and bold,

08:38.460 --> 08:41.670
but I don't want someone who can't follow rules.

08:41.700 --> 08:44.040
If that's fine with you, you can try the job.

08:44.470 --> 08:46.910
Those are your conditions?

08:46.910 --> 08:48.110
Yes.

08:48.110 --> 08:51.540
As long as I can work according to your rules,

08:51.540 --> 08:54.110
you won't have any issues?

08:54.150 --> 08:55.010
Yeah.

08:55.450 --> 08:58.080
Even if I'm a mongrel from the slum?

08:58.080 --> 08:59.120
No problem.

09:01.390 --> 09:03.860
Then, give me a shot.

09:03.920 --> 09:06.260
This shall be considered a binding contract.

09:15.130 --> 09:17.000
I'm Katze.

09:35.450 --> 09:39.130
Have they been treating you like a piece of trash?

09:39.160 --> 09:40.890
You hate it that much?

09:44.300 --> 09:48.300
Whoa, don't look at me like that, it's scary.

09:48.730 --> 09:53.140
I'm not pissed off at being treated like trash.

09:53.410 --> 09:57.980
I'm mad because they always do these pointless things!

10:00.880 --> 10:05.790
The instinct of prejudice cannot be easily wiped out,

10:05.820 --> 10:08.620
no matter how logically you justify equality.

10:09.560 --> 10:13.960
It's just the way the world works.

10:14.030 --> 10:15.230
I know that.

10:15.260 --> 10:17.430
You don't need to tell me that now.

10:17.460 --> 10:18.330
Oh?

10:18.360 --> 10:24.170
So the slum mongrel only wastes his freedom by wallowing in self-pity.

10:24.200 --> 10:26.140
You're the lowest form of garbage.

10:27.110 --> 10:30.440
There's not a big market for a simple delivery boy.

10:30.480 --> 10:32.650
So don't waste your energy.

10:32.680 --> 10:36.220
Keep your ears open and focused.

10:36.280 --> 10:39.650
No matter what, don't turn away from reality.

10:40.390 --> 10:43.960
But, keep your mouth firmly closed.

10:43.990 --> 10:46.430
That is how you become the best of the best.

10:46.490 --> 10:47.890
Got it?

11:00.270 --> 11:01.470
Katze.

11:04.110 --> 11:05.480
What?

11:05.510 --> 11:07.350
Are you ready for departure?

11:07.410 --> 11:09.980
AIec is doing the final check now.

11:10.020 --> 11:12.690
I'm here to collect the additional luggage.

11:12.720 --> 11:14.020
Wait a sec.

11:23.100 --> 11:26.170
This is... the additional luggage?

11:26.970 --> 11:27.030
Yes.

11:27.170 --> 11:31.340
I wasn't told that we were transporting humans in Cold Sleep.

11:31.400 --> 11:34.510
Transfer them to another ship at Laocoon.

11:36.510 --> 11:39.050
Only these two couldn't make it in time.

11:39.080 --> 11:43.520
That's why we're putting these in your ship last minute.

11:44.720 --> 11:50.260
These are Lanaya's special edition pieces.

11:50.260 --> 11:54.890
I thought the Lanaya Hugo sex dolls were out of production!

11:55.900 --> 11:57.960
That's what they announced to the public.

11:58.030 --> 12:05.370
But, there are some people who want these specially-made sex dolls at any price.

12:05.940 --> 12:09.240
Business is based on supply and demand.

12:09.280 --> 12:11.480
I know that!

12:11.510 --> 12:18.880
I'm just disgusted by perverts who modify prepubescent kids into sex dolls.

12:18.920 --> 12:23.560
You just need to deliver the goods to the right place at the right time.

12:23.590 --> 12:25.220
I said, I know!

13:20.450 --> 13:22.520
It's done...

13:22.580 --> 13:25.890
Time to report to Katze...

13:29.560 --> 13:32.660
Great, I'm done for the day.

13:37.100 --> 13:41.300
I'm gonna eat first, then crash.

13:49.740 --> 13:52.310
It's the Blondie from that day!

13:55.780 --> 13:58.580
You bastard... I won't let you go!

14:26.910 --> 14:29.920
The pass card Katze gave me doesn't work!

14:52.340 --> 14:55.840
Where did that damn Blondie go?!

15:12.020 --> 15:14.060
Here, huh...

15:16.830 --> 15:19.370
This place smells fishy.

15:19.370 --> 15:21.170
Does this thing open?

15:42.120 --> 15:45.560
What is... this place...

16:27.430 --> 16:29.640
Was that just my imagination?

16:30.900 --> 16:36.340
What am I scared about? I'll get teased again if I carry on like this.

16:59.770 --> 17:01.930
Exit... where's the exit?!

17:02.870 --> 17:05.400
WHY IS THERE NO DOOR?!

17:43.780 --> 17:45.810
Can I lend you a hand?

17:49.180 --> 17:53.490
Oh yes. You hate owing people favors, right?

17:54.450 --> 17:59.660
What a coincidence. Didn't think I'd see you again, in a place like this.

18:00.860 --> 18:02.830
Where's the exit?

18:02.860 --> 18:04.700
Dunno. Where do you think it is?

18:04.730 --> 18:08.300
I didn't come to shoot the shit with you.

18:08.330 --> 18:09.570
Where's the damned exit?!

18:09.600 --> 18:12.000
No matter how you act...

18:12.040 --> 18:13.840
...the situation doesn't change.

18:13.870 --> 18:15.740
Isn't that right, Riki?

18:18.740 --> 18:24.680
Didn't Katze warn you about excessive curiosity?

18:24.750 --> 18:28.020
How does he know Katze's name?

18:29.590 --> 18:33.490
Who the hell are you?

18:39.400 --> 18:42.070
Iason Mink.

18:44.670 --> 18:49.960
One month later

19:28.450 --> 19:31.150
I don't want any shame.

19:31.980 --> 19:38.520
Take him to parties and make him into a pet befitting of a Blondie.

19:49.640 --> 19:53.410
Open you legs wider. I can't see.

19:59.340 --> 20:00.980
More.

20:01.010 --> 20:05.750
If you don't listen to me, should I call Darryl?

20:29.580 --> 20:31.710
This is your pet ring.

20:31.710 --> 20:34.880
So we don't need collars and leads anymore.

20:34.910 --> 20:36.450
Correct.

20:36.480 --> 20:41.250
This pet ring will become your ID at Eos.

20:41.290 --> 20:43.220
Then give it to me already!

20:46.060 --> 20:47.290
Fine.

20:54.600 --> 20:56.940
It's a special D type.

20:56.940 --> 21:03.040
There are very few slum mongrels who are fitted with a jewelry-like pet ring.

21:03.940 --> 21:07.610
This disciplinary penis ring suits you.

22:31.300 --> 22:34.030
Riki!

23:02.430 --> 23:05.560
I shouldn't have drunk...

23:05.600 --> 23:08.070
It was a waste of money.

23:08.100 --> 23:09.000
Shit...

23:10.400 --> 23:12.770
Why now?

23:12.800 --> 23:16.140
Why did I have to see those fucked up things again?

23:16.880 --> 23:21.410
Shit... shit... shit...
